{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/b191a423cc034684443bc70ec897fe55.avif?t=1765737164\" width=570 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The <strong>CHALLENGE CREATOR\u00a0</strong>is a major update to <strong>THE HORDE WANTS YOU DEAD</strong> that allows you to setup challenges how you want to. This isn't just about tweaking how big the horde is or how strong enemies are, instead we've exposed most of the game's systems to the Challenge Creator.\u00a0 Create extreme setups, go crazy OP, make fiendishly difficult challenges - The game is entirely in your hands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/fcd669847c7eeccc8090ac5c47d5cc1f.webp?t=1765737164\" width=780 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/6d645e8350c10aa38b31d21d2c77b910.webp?t=1765737164\" width=616 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>THE HORDE WANTS YOU DEAD</strong> is a chaotic shoot'em up where you and your squad must survive against hundreds and thousands of angry and fearless enemies. The game is designed to be a challenging experience throughout - you won't find &quot;survivors-like&quot; OP upgrades or magical abilities here - it's just you, your weapon, some grenades and your teammates, as you use all your skill and focus to defeat ever more difficult horde onslaughts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/fcd669847c7eeccc8090ac5c47d5cc1f.webp?t=1765737164\" width=780 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/e192724d4351cefb748ff3efd326ac4a.webp?t=1765737164\" width=616 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/123f88b7ba0e828833c0aa87abf2034a.poster.avif?t=1765737164\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/123f88b7ba0e828833c0aa87abf2034a.webm?t=1765737164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/123f88b7ba0e828833c0aa87abf2034a.mp4?t=1765737164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Test your skills over 5 levels of challenge, with increasing horde size, new enemy types and new weapons. Keep your bullets flying, throw grenades at large groups, roll away from danger. Learn and adapt to different enemies. Use all the tools at your disposal to match their quickly overwhelming numbers. And when you're ready, try Endless mode and see how long you can survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/fcd669847c7eeccc8090ac5c47d5cc1f.webp?t=1765737164\" width=780 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/aa8413ca92946dc12f2a13b4037ea42f.webp?t=1765737164\" width=616 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/3d94a72dedc56c42cfb1bc703986d478.poster.avif?t=1765737164\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/3d94a72dedc56c42cfb1bc703986d478.webm?t=1765737164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/3d94a72dedc56c42cfb1bc703986d478.mp4?t=1765737164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your friends and play in 4-player online co-op. Strategize with your squad to focus on tougher enemies or try to split up the horde around the map. Keep each other alive and you might just stand a chance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/fcd669847c7eeccc8090ac5c47d5cc1f.webp?t=1765737164\" width=780 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/67225f812982b4e5e2ee2d9a57043023.webp?t=1765737164\" width=616 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/d6d9078a7401337f5ead3fb8e98800da.poster.avif?t=1765737164\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/d6d9078a7401337f5ead3fb8e98800da.webm?t=1765737164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/d6d9078a7401337f5ead3fb8e98800da.mp4?t=1765737164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With full ragdoll physics for all enemies, send bodies and dismembered limbs flying through the air with a perfectly placed grenade. Watch as blood spurts out from every hit, slash and bullet hole, dynamically covering the arena. Gaze upon the scarred battlefields, littered with cracks and scorch marks - you could almost call it art!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/fcd669847c7eeccc8090ac5c47d5cc1f.webp?t=1765737164\" width=780 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/f03e626644d2eb25893b3aa1936e1e0c.webp?t=1765737164\" width=616 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/f858f28939affc3e668681581ea1a09d.poster.avif?t=1765737164\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/f858f28939affc3e668681581ea1a09d.webm?t=1765737164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/f858f28939affc3e668681581ea1a09d.mp4?t=1765737164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Collect coins from downed enemies to earn supply crates with a selection of upgrades. From more health and faster movement to stronger grenades and lower cooldowns, improve your character and increase your fire power to keep up with the horde. Supplies are limited so pick wisely!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/fcd669847c7eeccc8090ac5c47d5cc1f.webp?t=1765737164\" width=780 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/f02010215a469b2df4a8e77b398b06a3.webp?t=1765737164\" width=616 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/7736ae76d8622651d2c00c22607be8f8.poster.avif?t=1765737164\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/7736ae76d8622651d2c00c22607be8f8.webm?t=1765737164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/7736ae76d8622651d2c00c22607be8f8.mp4?t=1765737164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fighting the horde is hard work but it pays off. Receive XP from kills, assists and wins, level up to gain skill points and then use them to permanently upgrade a stat of your choosing. Every little bit helps!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/fcd669847c7eeccc8090ac5c47d5cc1f.webp?t=1765737164\" width=780 height=49 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Just Getting Started","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3552820/983c252dafdafc947865182b4dfc07b1db76e8a2.jpg"},{"name":"Those Are Rookie Numbers","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3552820/983c252dafdafc947865182b4dfc07b1db76e8a2.jpg"},{"name":"Practice Makes Perfect","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3552820/983c252dafdafc947865182b4dfc07b1db76e8a2.jpg"},{"name":"Horde Exterminator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3552820/983c252dafdafc947865182b4dfc07b1db76e8a2.jpg"},{"name":"Fire In The Hole!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3552820/983c252dafdafc947865182b4dfc07b1db76e8a2.jpg"},{"name":"Explosive Personality","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3552820/983c252dafdafc947865182b4dfc07b1db76e8a2.jpg"},{"name":"Shrapnel Expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3552820/983c252dafdafc947865182b4dfc07b1db76e8a2.jpg"},{"name":"Michael Bay Would Be Proud","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3552820/983c252dafdafc947865182b4dfc07b1db76e8a2.jpg"},{"name":"Lone Wolf Master - Challenge Level 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3552820/983c252dafdafc947865182b4dfc07b1db76e8a2.jpg"},{"name":"Lone Wolf Master - Challenge Level 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3552820/983c252dafdafc947865182b4dfc07b1db76e8a2.jpg"}],"total":40},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3552820?t=1765737164","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/92b795b84873e1575049b7e34c9f255be29ebb6b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765737164","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/482f2c80917f319f9b165a99c968eb47e5e615aa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765737164","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/482f2c80917f319f9b165a99c968eb47e5e615aa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765737164","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains blood, dismemberment and violence that may not be suitable for all audiences. The blood and dismemberment can both be disabled in the game's settings."},"demos":[{"appid":3715300,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/b191a423cc034684443bc70ec897fe55.avif?t=1765737164\" width=570 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The <strong>CHALLENGE CREATOR\u00a0</strong>is a major update to <strong>THE HORDE WANTS YOU DEAD</strong> that allows you to setup challenges how you want to. This isn't just about tweaking how big the horde is or how strong enemies are, instead we've exposed most of the game's systems to the Challenge Creator.\u00a0 Create extreme setups, go crazy OP, make fiendishly difficult challenges - The game is entirely in your hands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/fcd669847c7eeccc8090ac5c47d5cc1f.webp?t=1765737164\" width=780 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/6d645e8350c10aa38b31d21d2c77b910.webp?t=1765737164\" width=616 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>THE HORDE WANTS YOU DEAD</strong> is a chaotic shoot'em up where you and your squad must survive against hundreds and thousands of angry and fearless enemies. The game is designed to be a challenging experience throughout - you won't find &quot;survivors-like&quot; OP upgrades or magical abilities here - it's just you, your weapon, some grenades and your teammates, as you use all your skill and focus to defeat ever more difficult horde onslaughts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/fcd669847c7eeccc8090ac5c47d5cc1f.webp?t=1765737164\" width=780 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/e192724d4351cefb748ff3efd326ac4a.webp?t=1765737164\" width=616 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/123f88b7ba0e828833c0aa87abf2034a.poster.avif?t=1765737164\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/123f88b7ba0e828833c0aa87abf2034a.webm?t=1765737164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/123f88b7ba0e828833c0aa87abf2034a.mp4?t=1765737164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Test your skills over 5 levels of challenge, with increasing horde size, new enemy types and new weapons. Keep your bullets flying, throw grenades at large groups, roll away from danger. Learn and adapt to different enemies. Use all the tools at your disposal to match their quickly overwhelming numbers. And when you're ready, try Endless mode and see how long you can survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/fcd669847c7eeccc8090ac5c47d5cc1f.webp?t=1765737164\" width=780 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/aa8413ca92946dc12f2a13b4037ea42f.webp?t=1765737164\" width=616 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/3d94a72dedc56c42cfb1bc703986d478.poster.avif?t=1765737164\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/3d94a72dedc56c42cfb1bc703986d478.webm?t=1765737164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/3d94a72dedc56c42cfb1bc703986d478.mp4?t=1765737164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your friends and play in 4-player online co-op. Strategize with your squad to focus on tougher enemies or try to split up the horde around the map. Keep each other alive and you might just stand a chance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/fcd669847c7eeccc8090ac5c47d5cc1f.webp?t=1765737164\" width=780 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/67225f812982b4e5e2ee2d9a57043023.webp?t=1765737164\" width=616 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/d6d9078a7401337f5ead3fb8e98800da.poster.avif?t=1765737164\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/d6d9078a7401337f5ead3fb8e98800da.webm?t=1765737164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/d6d9078a7401337f5ead3fb8e98800da.mp4?t=1765737164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With full ragdoll physics for all enemies, send bodies and dismembered limbs flying through the air with a perfectly placed grenade. Watch as blood spurts out from every hit, slash and bullet hole, dynamically covering the arena. Gaze upon the scarred battlefields, littered with cracks and scorch marks - you could almost call it art!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/fcd669847c7eeccc8090ac5c47d5cc1f.webp?t=1765737164\" width=780 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/f03e626644d2eb25893b3aa1936e1e0c.webp?t=1765737164\" width=616 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/f858f28939affc3e668681581ea1a09d.poster.avif?t=1765737164\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/f858f28939affc3e668681581ea1a09d.webm?t=1765737164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/f858f28939affc3e668681581ea1a09d.mp4?t=1765737164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Collect coins from downed enemies to earn supply crates with a selection of upgrades. From more health and faster movement to stronger grenades and lower cooldowns, improve your character and increase your fire power to keep up with the horde. Supplies are limited so pick wisely!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/fcd669847c7eeccc8090ac5c47d5cc1f.webp?t=1765737164\" width=780 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/f02010215a469b2df4a8e77b398b06a3.webp?t=1765737164\" width=616 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/7736ae76d8622651d2c00c22607be8f8.poster.avif?t=1765737164\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/7736ae76d8622651d2c00c22607be8f8.webm?t=1765737164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/7736ae76d8622651d2c00c22607be8f8.mp4?t=1765737164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fighting the horde is hard work but it pays off. Receive XP from kills, assists and wins, level up to gain skill points and then use them to permanently upgrade a stat of your choosing. Every little bit helps!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/fcd669847c7eeccc8090ac5c47d5cc1f.webp?t=1765737164\" width=780 height=49 /></span></p>","developers":["Bellyflop Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/f679ba0e8040cef05772